    <nyt:latest_use rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#date">2009-03-08</nyt:latest_use>
    <skos:inScheme rdf:resource="http://data.nytimes.com/elements/nytd_org"/>
    <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="en">Conservative Political Action Conference</skos:prefLabel>
    <nyt:search_api_query rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">http://api.nytimes.com/svc/search/v1/article?query=+nytd_org_facet%3A%5BConservative+Political+Action+Conference%5D&amp;rank=newest&amp;fields=abstract,author,body,byline,classifiers_facet,column_facet,date,day_of_week_facet,des_facet,desk_facet,fee,geo_facet,lead_paragraph,material_type_facet,multimedia,nytd_byline,nytd_des_facet,nytd_geo_facet,nytd_lead_paragraph,nytd_org_facet,nytd_per_facet,nytd_section_facet,nytd_title,nytd_works_mentioned_facet,org_facet,page_facet,per_facet,publication_day,publication_month,publication_year,section_page_facet,small_image_height,small_image_url,small_image_width,source_facet,title,url,word_count,works_mentioned_facet</nyt:search_api_query>
    <owl:sameAs rdf:resource="http://data.nytimes.com/conservative_political_action_conference_org"/>
    <nyt:associated_article_count rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">5</nyt:associated_article_count>
    <skos:definition xml:lang="en">Updated: Feb. 27, 2009
The Conservative Political Action Conference, an annual gathering of American conservative organizations, has played a powerful role in the Republican Party’s ascent in national politics since it was first organized in 1973.
Sponsored by the American Conservative Union, an umbrella group founded in 1964, the conference started as the preserve of a small band of Barry Goldwater supporters who railed from the outside against the Republican Party of Richard M. Nixon and Gerald R. Ford. But after the rise and election of Ronald Reagan, the annual event became a focal point for party activists, a reflection of how much the lines between the conservative movement and the Republican Party have blurred.</skos:definition>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#Concept"/>
    <owl:sameAs rdf:resource="http://rdf.freebase.com/ns/en.conservative_political_action_conference"/>
    <nyt:number_of_variants rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</nyt:number_of_variants>
